  </p>
  <p>
    A suspension is not lifted by closing your account. If an operator has suspended you, the suspension comes back with the account, and only an operator can take it off.
  </p>
  <p>
    After thirty days your personal details are overwritten and the account cannot be brought back at all. The record that an account existed and when it closed is kept; nothing here is a way to have your data kept — it is the opposite. What we do with it either way is on our
     
